 ## Operating characteristics
 
 ### Time and Memory Complexity
-*   **Construction:** Requires computing the contour tree and then iteratively pruning pairs. The pruning step is proportional to the number of critical points [S1][S2, unofficial].
-*   **Storage:** The branch decomposition stores one node per prunable saddle-extremum pair. Memory usage is linear with respect to the number of critical points [S1][S2, unofficial].
